                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Absolutely! All of our products are 100% genuine and backed by the manufacturer's warranties. We are also the main authorised distributor for the complete San Hima range, as well as other premium international adventure gear brands in the United Arab Emirates. You can shop our full range at <a href=\"https://sanhima.ae/\">https://sanhima.ae/</a></p>",
